  // Product Detail — remaining hardcoded body text
  'product.shipping_desc': { en: 'We ship globally via air and sea freight. FOB, CIF, and DDP terms available. Standard lead time for production is 45-60 days post-sample approval.', fr: 'Nous expédions dans le monde entier par fret aérien et maritime. Conditions FOB, CIF et DDP disponibles. Le délai standard de production est de 45 à 60 jours après approbation de l\'échantillon.', tw: 'Yɛde nnoɔma kɔ wiase nyinaa denam air ne sea freight so. FOB, CIF, ne DDP terms wɔ hɔ. Production lead time yɛ nnafua 45-60 sample approval akyiri.', sw: 'Tunasafirisha kimataifa kupitia usafiri wa anga na bahari. Masharti ya FOB, CIF, na DDP yanapatikana. Muda wa kawaida wa uzalishaji ni siku 45-60 baada ya kibali cha sampuli.', ha: 'Muna jigilar kaya zuwa duniya baki ɗaya ta jiragen sama da na ruwa. Sharuɗɗan FOB, CIF, da DDP suna samuwa. Lokacin samarwa na yau da kullun shine kwanaki 45-60 bayan amincewar samfuri.' },
  'product.sust_desc': { en: 'Our manufacturing partners are OEKO-TEX certified. We utilize eco-friendly dyes and offer organic cotton alternatives upon request.', fr: 'Nos partenaires de fabrication sont certifiés OEKO-TEX. Nous utilisons des teintures écologiques et proposons des alternatives en coton biologique sur demande.', tw: 'Yɛn manufacturing partners wɔ OEKO-TEX certification. Yɛde eco-friendly dyes yɛ adwuma na yɛde organic cotton alternatives ma wɔn a wɔpɛ.', sw: 'Washirika wetu wa utengenezaji wameidhinishwa na OEKO-TEX. Tunatumia rangi rafiki kwa mazingira na kutoa mbadala za pamba ya kikaboni kwa ombi.', ha: 'Abokan hulɗarmu na masana\'anta suna da takaddun OEKO-TEX. Muna amfani da rina masu kyau ga muhalli kuma muna ba da zaɓin auduga na halitta bisa buƙata.' },

